Description: High-performance native Rust AI voice dictation studio
 Wflow is a lightweight, ultra-fast native speech-to-text voice dictation application
 featuring real-time gRPC streaming, Groq Whisper LPU, and ElevenLabs Scribe STT.
 .
 It runs quietly in the system tray and allows seamless dictation into any application.
